   "description": "Hades is a deep-tech company pioneering laser-based drilling technology to access ultra-deep geothermal energy and critical minerals previously unreachable by traditional methods. By combining industrial-grade lasers with advanced subsurface engineering, Hades is developing efficient, contact-free drilling through hard rock at depths of up to 15 km.\n\nStarting in Europe, Hades is building a vertically integrated geothermal and mining operator, turning its proprietary laser-drilling technology into a platform for clean baseload power and secure mineral supply. The company's mission is to make deep-geothermal energy commercially viable everywhere.",
   "founded": 2025,
   "headcount": "~20",
   "highlight": "Developing the world's first industrial-scale laser-drilling system for geothermal energy and critical mineral extraction.",
