   "description": "Metycle operates the leading managed marketplace for international scrap and recycled metal trade. Its platform connects collectors with recyclers and smelters globally, handling quality assurance, logistics, and payments end-to-end — strengthening Europe's access to critical raw materials and reducing dependency on primary metal imports.\n\nAt its core sits a proprietary AI-powered sorting process that determines the physical and chemical properties of shredded metals in real time — enabling precise classification and shorter trade routes. With the EU's Critical Raw Materials Act and a 15-million-tonne scrap deficit projected by 2030, Metycle is building essential infrastructure for European resource sovereignty.",
   "founded": 2022,
   "headcount": "~40",
   "highlight": "Building critical infrastructure for European resource sovereignty ahead of a projected 15 million tonne scrap deficit by 2030.",
