   "description": "Black Semiconductor is pioneering a new class of semiconductor devices by integrating graphene-based photonic interconnects directly onto electronic chips. This breakthrough enables thousands of chips to communicate as one, unlocking ultra-fast data transfer, lower energy use, and greater system efficiency.\n\nThe company is establishing its FabONE production facility to bring large-scale graphene-enabled chip manufacturing to Europe. By combining advanced photonics with mature semiconductor processes, Black Semiconductor is setting new standards for computing performance and sustainability in the post-Moore era.",
