   "description": "Artificial Instinct is developing digital, passive, low-latency night-vision systems that deliver full-color, wide-field, ultra-responsive visibility for soldiers and autonomous platforms. The company's two-phase roadmap begins with a low-light color camera module for drones and ground robots, followed by next-generation goggles that act as a soldier's on-eye computer — combining situational awareness, navigation overlays, and AI-powered vision.",
