   "description": "Linexa is building the intelligence layer for brownfield manufacturing. Its platform connects to systems across production sites — regardless of vendor — capturing and structuring automation logic into one unified model. For the first time, engineers get full transparency over what is actually running on the shop floor.\n\nBy enabling teams to simulate and validate changes before deployment, Linexa dramatically speeds up troubleshooting and eliminates the need to work inside each vendor's system individually. The result: less downtime, lower reliance on external integrators, and faster modernization, providing the operational foundation to keep European manufacturing competitive at a global scale.",
   "founded": 2025,
   "headcount": "~10",
   "highlight": "Building the first cross-vendor automation platform to keep European manufacturing globally competitive.",
