   "description": "Labrys Technologies builds Axiom, a command-and-control platform designed to help organisations manage, verify, and pay distributed teams operating in high-risk or disconnected regions. Initially developed from real-world fieldwork in defence and humanitarian operations, Axiom brings together secure multilingual communication, geo-tracking, and crypto-based payments into a single operational environment. It replaces fragmented tools like WhatsApp or spreadsheets with a unified, auditable system that ensures trust, accountability, and speed for missions.",
