   "description": "Vaeridion is building the next generation of sustainable aviation with the Microliner — a fully electric aircraft engineered for regional routes and everyday air mobility. Combining advanced aerodynamics, intelligent energy management, and integrated battery-wing technology, the Microliner delivers clean, quiet, and efficient flight for short-haul transport across Europe.\n\nVaeridion brings together deep technical expertise in electric propulsion, aircraft certification, and energy systems. The company's mission is to make zero-emission regional aviation a scalable reality.",
