   "description": "Scipio develops intelligent software to optimize inventory and supply chains for European armed forces. Its platform enables route recalculation, inventory visibility, and cross-border interoperability — empowering military units to move materials and troops faster, safer, and with complete situational awareness.\n\nBuilt for dual-use deployment, Scipio serves as the next-generation logistics layer between traditional ERP systems and command operations (C2/C4ISR), offering flexibility legacy tools like LOGFAS cannot match. By connecting data across nations, Scipio enhances resilience, readiness, and operational efficiency in dynamic conflict environments.",
   "founded": 2024,
   "headcount": "~10",
