   "description": "Micropsi Industries develops advanced AI software that gives robots human-like adaptability. Its flagship product, MIRAI, enables robots to handle dynamic tasks, using real-time sensor data and computer vision to react intelligently to changing conditions on the factory floor.\n\nBy combining reinforcement learning and visual perception, Micropsi bridges the gap between traditional automation and flexible, autonomous production. The technology empowers manufacturers to automate high-variance, precision tasks such as cable plugging, assembly, and inspection.",
